{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/ea5275134f5d0f03eedf6ac1ce925fac.avif?t=1773213746\" width=1280 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/949f4ef1f95f7c25e1c30f209f22c032.poster.avif?t=1773213746\" width=130 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/949f4ef1f95f7c25e1c30f209f22c032.webm?t=1773213746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nebularena immerses you in futuristic PvP battles on space platforms, completely automated through your strategy. You will create the ultimate ship that will confront the constructions of other players in deathmatches where anything goes...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your ultimate structure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/3822c981890c1705246526868cce2bd5.poster.avif?t=1773213746\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/3822c981890c1705246526868cce2bd5.webm?t=1773213746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/3822c981890c1705246526868cce2bd5.mp4?t=1773213746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination merge with your best strategy and shape the perfect space platform. Massive, compact, agile, or aggressive \u2014 the design of your ship will have a decisive impact in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominate in automated battles and climb the Arena ladder.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/e189f87e2eba06d957707c67111401f6.poster.avif?t=1773213746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/e189f87e2eba06d957707c67111401f6.webm?t=1773213746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/e189f87e2eba06d957707c67111401f6.mp4?t=1773213746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against other players\u2019 space platforms in intense deathmatches where <i>every</i> strategy is fair game. Collisions, impacts, explosions, shockwaves, gunfire \u2014 enjoy the spectacle of fully automated combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash a powerful arsenal and choose your tech path.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/13c09e163f8995743bbb846390bf201e.poster.avif?t=1773213746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/13c09e163f8995743bbb846390bf201e.webm?t=1773213746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/13c09e163f8995743bbb846390bf201e.mp4?t=1773213746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your tactics by picking from 4 main Cores, each unlocking dozens of buildings with unique functions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack towers</strong> (machine guns, flamethrowers, shotguns\u2026)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robot factories</strong> (offensive, repair, or defensive bots)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command towers</strong> (ship movement and speed, ramming, evasion\u2026)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master spatial balance.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/94d60b15ed4ce71cb117a8f9f41c4f6d.poster.avif?t=1773213746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/94d60b15ed4ce71cb117a8f9f41c4f6d.webm?t=1773213746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/94d60b15ed4ce71cb117a8f9f41c4f6d.mp4?t=1773213746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set-up your movement strategy: rush your adversary with spikes or try to avoid projectiles!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >develop and compose through various technologies. Mix liquid fire weapons with plasma shields!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your core, your playstyle! Choose a true slow bulkwark, or a fast pace energy generator!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack the bonuses: check on the technoogy tree for passives; and stack bonuses through item's rarity, and modules!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp and manage the key parameters of a competitive platform: energy, weight, and space. Mastering these elements is the key to victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain battles together and prove yourself in the fastest, most explosive fights of NebulArena!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/d17a8369d2041144d0e973b77da0b276.poster.avif?t=1773213746\" width=130 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/d17a8369d2041144d0e973b77da0b276.webm?t=1773213746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1773213746\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1773213746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1773213746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634320?t=1773213746","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/b61aa5ea2ed605f9721bfd0888600b223df50ed2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773213746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/881145cd01f0601904f24c8160210858b1039360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773213746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634320/881145cd01f0601904f24c8160210858b103936